  "type": "comment",
  "z": "mcs8m.bdash.tab",
  "name": "START HERE: double-click 'EDIT SETTINGS HERE' (bridge address, names, buttons)",
  "info": "1. EDIT SETTINGS HERE: bridge_url, bridge_token, input names, button sources.\n2. Button labels: double-click each button to rename it.\nThe bridge must be running: python3 bridge/mcs8m_bridge.py",
